    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">귀속 과제연도기록</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#BudgetAllocation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b44"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b45"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b46"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">예산배분</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Budget allocation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">세부사업×연도×금액(×재원×산정기준)의 재화. 같은 사업·연도에 산정기준이 다른 금액(예산서 확정액, 과제 협약액 합산)이 공존할 수 있다.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b62">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction"/>
    <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#toGoal"/>
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
    <owl:onClass rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#PolicyGoal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b61">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction"/>
    <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#ofProgram"/>
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
    <owl:onClass rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#RnDProgram"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#FundingAgency">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#Organization"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전문기관</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Funding agency</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">부처와 수행기관 사이의 국내 특유 중간 역할. CERIF 대응물 불완전.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#orgCode">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">기관 코드</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#Organization"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">NTIS 기관 코드(예: B350021) 또는 재정 소관 코드. 코드 체계는 codeScheme 주석으로 구분.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#forIndicator">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#IndicatorObservation"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#PerformanceIndicator"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">관측 대상 지표</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#assignedField">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#FieldAssignment"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#TechnologyField"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">배정 기술분야</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#ministryTechClass">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">부처기술분류</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#ProjectYearRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">P2. NTIS 예시에서 일부 부처는 이 항목에 사업 계층명을 기재 — 사업 동일성 판정의 보조 근거로만 사용.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#leadPerformer">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#performedBy"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">주관연구개발기관</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">NTIS 과제검색 ResearchAgency. 공개 API가 제공하는 유일한 수행기관 역할.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#ProjectYearRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#PerformingOrganization"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b44">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction"/>
    <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#ofProgram"/>
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
    <owl:onClass rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#RnDProgram"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#RnDProgram">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">국가연구개발사업(세부사업)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R&amp;D program (budget activity)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">재정 예산체계의 세부사업(dBrain 최하위 사업 단위)에 대응한다. NTIS 과제검색의 BudgetProject(사업명)와 예산사업 코드 23~24자리의 말단 3자리(세부사업 코드)가 이 층위임을 근거로 한다(A11). 연도에 따라 예산 코드가 바뀌어도 동일 개체로 유지되며, 연도별 코드는 BudgetAllocation 에 기록한다.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b57">
    <rdf:first rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b55"/>
    <rdf:rest rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil"/>
  </rdf:Description>
