  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#DataSnapshot">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">수집 스냅샷</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Collection snapshot</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">한 번의 수집 실행으로 저장된 원본 응답 묶음. 수집 시각·질의 조건은 CollectionActivity 에 기록.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#inFiscalYear">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">회계연도</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">연도 의존 개체가 속한 회계연도. v0.3.3에서 도메인을 명시(OOPS! P11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b39"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#FiscalYear"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b18">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction"/>
    <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#assignedField"/>
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
    <owl:onClass rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#TechnologyField"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#FieldAssignment">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b17"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b18"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b19"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">분야 배정</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Field assignment</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">과제연도기록×기술분야×순위(×비중)의 재화. 법정 서식은 1~3순위와 비중을 기재하나 공개 API는 순위만 제공하므로 비중은 선택 항목이다.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#Organization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/org#Organization"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">기관</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Organization</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#rollupRule">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">집계 규칙</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b66"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">예: 연구비 합산, 성과 ID 기준 중복 제거, 1순위 분야 귀속, 순위가중 귀속, 시차 적용, 최근연도 절단.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b60">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction"/>
    <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#forIndicator"/>
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
    <owl:onClass rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#PerformanceIndicator"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#FiscalYear">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">회계연도</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Fiscal year</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n0184b59e9c524ac9bb403f1c7b25b5a5b52">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction"/>
    <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#attributedTo"/>
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
    <owl:onClass rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#ProjectYearRecord"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#RnDSubProgram">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">내역사업</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sub-activity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">세부사업 아래의 내역사업(NTIS BigprojectTitle). dBrain에 탑재되지 않는 하위 분류이며 CERIF에 직접 대응물이 없다. v0.2 레이블 '세부사업'을 정정.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#performerCategory">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">연구수행주체</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#ProjectYearRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">NTIS PerformAgent 코드. 값은 연구수행주체 ConceptScheme(nrdp-schemes.ttl).</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nrdp/ontology#assignmentOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
